1
00:00:00,680 --> 00:00:02,760
(Gablehouser:)AA, I need your answer.

2
00:00:03,725 --> 00:00:04,765
[BUZZER SOUNDS]

3
00:00:04,934 --> 00:00:07,104
The answer is minus eight pi alpha.

4
00:00:07,270 --> 00:00:09,190
(Sheldon:)Hang on a second.
That's not our answer.

5
00:00:09,355 --> 00:00:11,315
(Sheldon:)- What are you doing?
- Answering question.

6
00:00:11,482 --> 00:00:13,692
(Third Floor Janitor:)Winning Physics Bowl.

7
00:00:15,153 --> 00:00:17,113
(Sheldon:)How do you know anything
about physics?

8
00:00:17,280 --> 00:00:21,700
(Third Floor Janitor:)Here, I am janitor.
In former Soviet Union, I am physicist.

9
00:00:22,201 --> 00:00:23,991
Leningrad Politechnika.

10
00:00:24,495 --> 00:00:26,325
(Third Floor Janitor:)Go, Polar Bears.

11
00:00:29,250 --> 00:00:30,790
(Sheldon:)That's a delightful little story.

12
00:00:30,960 --> 00:00:33,210
(Sheldon:)Our arrangement was
you sit and not say anything.

13
00:00:33,379 --> 00:00:35,919
(Sheldon:)- I answer the questions.
- You didn't answer question.

14
00:00:36,090 --> 00:00:39,340
(Sheldon:)Hey, look. Now, maybe you have democracy
now in your beloved Russia...

15
00:00:39,510 --> 00:00:42,390
(Sheldon:)...but on this Physics Bowl team,
I rule with an iron fist.

16
00:00:42,555 --> 00:00:43,845
(Sheldon:)Ow!

17
00:00:44,515 --> 00:00:46,515
(Gablehouser:)AA, I need your official answer.

18
00:00:46,684 --> 00:00:48,774
(Sheldon:)- It's not what he said.
- Then what is it?

19
00:00:48,936 --> 00:00:51,106
- I want a different question.
- You can't.

